I want to see '$' symbols with different colors! :-)
I certainly don't see it as negative, but if you do, you are free to not use it.
There are (as far as I know) no plans of including it in the official
nethack, it will be an add-on for version 3.1.

Besides, one of the things I like about nethack is the enormous complexity.
(We could have only one kind of weapon, with different base enhanchements
 to get more or less powerful versions.  Instead we have different
 types with different names, colors and special effects.)
It is definitely not the kind of game that is meant to be solved in
one specific way, wich you may repeat forever after solving it the first time.
Different money types adds new decisions.  Carrying lots of copper will be
heavy, but if you change it into 100 zorkmid bills you`ll risk to burn it.
Change it to a very valuable mithril coin, and the risk of theft 
becomes larger.  (Leprechauns only steal some of your coins if you have many.)
Programming things like nethack is fun, that's another reason.

